    "created_at": "2016-12-07T02:03:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-12-07T02:03:43Z",
    "body": "For Gecko, implementing [indexed, rest, symbols] would be a lot simpler than [indexed, symbols, rest], because [indexed, rest] come from a normal WindowProxy and the symbols come from a cross-origin membrane around it...  We _could_ probably do the other; it would just be a bit more complicated.",
