    "body": "IIUC, Blink/V8 never returns symbols, right?  It seems not harder for Blink/V8 to put symbols last than to put symbols between indices and ordinary keys.  Probably, we just need to concatenate the current result and the result of Object.getOwnPropertySymbols().  And it seems better to follow the same way as ECMAScript.  So, I agreed.",
